[00:00.00]Tick-tick
[00:00.89]pretty cage
[00:02.38]good girl
[00:03.27]please behave
[00:04.94]Little star
[00:05.78]don’t run wild
[00:07.10]nice machines
[00:08.13]like quiet children
[00:10.25]♫
[00:14.97]I’m wrapped up in velvet blankets
[00:17.32]watching puppies in the light
[00:19.79]stars are flickering through my visor
[00:22.12]like puzzles I can bite
[00:24.74]Dad says
[00:25.44]“Stay where it is safe”
[00:26.42]“Let the system run the show”
[00:27.63]But rules look like riddles
[00:28.90]and I really love to know
[00:30.30]There’s The Princess in the gardens
[00:31.51]with a fire in her stare
[00:32.59]There’s The Dancer in the hangar
[00:33.86]making engines breathe air
[00:35.22]And me?
[00:36.09]I’m hiding in the wiring
[00:37.80]where the quiet circuits hum
[00:39.95]If curiosity’s illegal
[00:42.38]then the game has just begun
[00:45.03]Hey
[00:45.30]Little glitch
[00:45.91]little spark
[00:46.51]tiny storm
[00:47.07]inside the Ark
[00:47.77]Code bends
[00:48.42]when you grin
[00:49.03]rules crack
[00:49.64]paper thin
[00:50.20]Princess fire
[00:50.85]Dancer steel
[00:51.55]you’re the bug
[00:52.11]they can’t repeal
[00:52.72]Break the grid
[00:53.38]kick the sun
[00:53.98]kid — you’re only getting started
[00:55.53]run
[00:58.08]Maybe that’s the problem
[00:59.46]maybe that’s the thrill
[01:00.52]If the door says
[01:01.34]DO NOT OPEN
[01:04.14]I already will
[01:05.93]HACK YOUR LIFE — DONT BE A NPC
[01:07.95]GLITCH YOUR HEART — SET YOUR CODE FREE
[01:10.52]Stars in my head
[01:11.87]noise in my lungs
[01:13.03]If the Ark says stop
[01:14.25]I press rerun
[01:15.87]HACK YOUR LIFE — BREAK THE LOOP
[01:18.30]CRASH THE SCRIPT — REWRITE THE TRUTH
[01:20.82]Pretty cage
[01:22.00]perfect lie
[01:23.21]watch me crash
[01:24.24]your paradise
[01:30.48]Mom says people can be monsters
[01:32.76]machines are easier to read
[01:35.50]But machines don’t hide intentions
[01:37.66]under velvet empathy
[01:40.78]The Princess walks through shadows
[01:41.99]like the Ark belongs to her
[01:43.34]The Dancer spins through engines
[01:44.46]like the stars obey her blur
[01:45.86]But the vents keep softly whispering
[01:46.89]like a secret learning breath
[01:48.06]Something scratching in the metal
[01:49.44]something curious beneath
[01:50.55]Rats or ghosts or broken code
[01:51.89]I don’t care what’s crawling through
[01:53.26]Mysteries are oxygen
[01:54.66]and boredom kills me too
[01:57.96]Yeah
[01:58.86]Vent ghosts
[01:59.70]metal lungs
[02:01.15]Ark’s asleep
[02:02.18]but you’re young
[02:03.91]Break locks
[02:04.84]twist code
[02:06.25]watch the quiet
[02:07.05]overload
[02:08.72]Princess burns
[02:09.89]Dancer flies
[02:11.06]you’re the glitch
[02:12.42]in disguise
[02:13.69]Let it spark
[02:14.86]let it run
[02:16.07]If the cage holds
[02:17.48]break the sun
[02:18.60]Good girls stay inside the garden
[02:21.32]Good girls never touch the sky
[02:23.65]Good girls listen to the system
[02:26.13]I just smile
[02:27.18]and press retry
[02:31.14]HACK YOUR LIFE — DONT BE A NPC
[02:33.80]GLITCH YOUR HEART — SET YOUR CODE FREE
[02:36.37]Stars in my head
[02:37.40]glitch in my lungs
[02:38.62]If the Ark says stop
[02:39.64]I press rerun
[02:41.49]HACK YOUR LIFE — BREAK THE LOOP
[02:43.80]CRASH THE SCRIPT — REWRITE THE TRUTH
[02:46.41]Pretty cage
[02:47.52]perfect lie
[02:48.81]watch me crash
[02:49.79]your paradise
[02:51.27]Tick-tick
[02:52.11]pretty cage
[02:53.48]good girl
[02:54.79]behave
[02:55.98]Too bad
[02:58.04]I never learned
[03:00.34]how
